565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Failure of adhesive joint can be predicted by three mode, adhesive failure, cohesive failure and mixed \(adhesive and cohesive\) failure. Showing all the three modes of failure. The failure in adhesive joint can be visualized at the adhesive adhered joint interface. Adhesive failure occurs due to improper surface preparation, wrong adhesive selection and high peel stress. An improper surface preparation reduces the mechanical interlocking between adhesive and adherent which may result in adhesive failure. Wrong adhesive selection again reduces the adhesion between adhesive and adhered which causes adhesive mode of failure. In cohesive mode of failure, either adhered fail or adhesive fail. It is due to high bond strength between adhesive and adhered than their individual strength. In mixed type of failure, adhesive and cohesive failure takes place simultaneously. )
/E (Failure of adhesive joint can be predicted by three mode, adhesive failure, cohesive failure and mixed \(adhesive and cohesive\) failure. Showing all the three modes of failure. The failure in adhesive joint can be visualized at the adhesive adhered joint interface. Adhesive failure occurs due to improper surface preparation, wrong adhesive selection and high peel stress. An improper surface preparation reduces the mechanical interlocking between adhesive and adherent which may result in adhesive failure. Wrong adhesive selection again reduces the adhesion between adhesive and adhered which causes adhesive mode of failure. In cohesive mode of failure, either adhered fail or adhesive fail. It is due to high bond strength between adhesive and adhered than their individual strength. In mixed type of failure, adhesive and cohesive failure takes place simultaneously. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8 9]
>>
endobj
