583 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Mechanical joining is one of the oldest methods for joining of different kind of materials. It is also frequently used for joining of composites. Thermosets and thermoplastics matrix composites both can be joined by mechanical joining. Among all type of mechanical joining, mechanical fastening is most common technique for mechanical joining. It provides easy assembly and disassembly of components. Therefore, maintenance of joint is very easy in case of mechanical fastening. There is one major defect of mechanical fastening is drilling hole on joining component for fixing the fastener. Presence of hole increases the stress concentration near joining interface and further result for failure of joint. In case composite, drilling a hole is more challenging than metals. )
/E (Mechanical joining is one of the oldest methods for joining of different kind of materials. It is also frequently used for joining of composites. Thermosets and thermoplastics matrix composites both can be joined by mechanical joining. Among all type of mechanical joining, mechanical fastening is most common technique for mechanical joining. It provides easy assembly and disassembly of components. Therefore, maintenance of joint is very easy in case of mechanical fastening. There is one major defect of mechanical fastening is drilling hole on joining component for fixing the fastener. Presence of hole increases the stress concentration near joining interface and further result for failure of joint. In case composite, drilling a hole is more challenging than metals. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [10 11]
>>
